The inclusive $\Hllll$ measurements are compared with SM NNLO theoretical estimations where acceptance of dominant $\ggH$ contribution is estimated using {\sc powheg} at  $\sqrt{s}$=13\TeV and {\sc HRes}~\cite{Grazzini:2013mca,deFlorian:2012mx} at  $\sqrt{s}$=7 and 8\TeV. Total gluon fusion cross section and associated uncertainty has been taken from Ref.~\cite{Anastasiou2016}. 
Definition of fiducial volume for $\sqrt{s}$=6--9\TeV uses the lepton isolation definition from Ref.~\cite{CMSH4lFiducial8TeV}, while for $\sqrt{s}$=12--14\TeV the definition described in the text is used.

